    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/794688594dced71d27ac0814f0ae2a98.poster.avif?t=1744289496\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/794688594dced71d27ac0814f0ae2a98.webm?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/794688594dced71d27ac0814f0ae2a98.mp4?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The prologue is only part of the full game and is completely free. Every player will be able to play it and see what awaits them in the full version of the game.<br><br><strong>Hollow Survivors: Prologue</strong>\u00a0is a\u00a0rogue-like dungeon crawler where you play as one of the few remaining sane Hollows. Slash through hordes of\u00a0<i>horrific</i> creatures and fight your way to the <i>top of the\u00a0Tower</i>. Discover new weapons and upgrades, and confront the evil cult that turned you into a Hollow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/769b89ccc58b5c704e293af239dba2c3.poster.avif?t=1744289496\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/769b89ccc58b5c704e293af239dba2c3.webm?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/769b89ccc58b5c704e293af239dba2c3.mp4?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > FACE POWERFUL ENEMIES</h2>Unleash your fury, <strong>crush your enemies</strong> and triumph over <strong>menacing bosses</strong> that stand in your path. Nothing can stop you from achieving your goal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/e45371ba9e17057b96b7488d02099207.poster.avif?t=1744289496\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/e45371ba9e17057b96b7488d02099207.webm?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/e45371ba9e17057b96b7488d02099207.mp4?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR WEAPON</h2>Pick a weapon that best suits your combat style. Use a <strong>swift scythe</strong> to quickly cut down your enemies or wield a <strong>great axe</strong> to overwhelm them with power.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/c90e67a0c227fc57c0a10d89cdabb32f.poster.avif?t=1744289496\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/c90e67a0c227fc57c0a10d89cdabb32f.webm?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/c90e67a0c227fc57c0a10d89cdabb32f.mp4?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW STRONGER</h2>Death is not the end in Hollow Survivors: Prologue. Utilize the souls you gather to purchase <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> from other Hollows, ensuring that you grow stronger with each run.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/598798138ef83b6be4e680a2fb3a1bc5.poster.avif?t=1744289496\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/598798138ef83b6be4e680a2fb3a1bc5.webm?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/598798138ef83b6be4e680a2fb3a1bc5.mp4?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEFRIEND OTHER HOLLOWS</h2>Grow your <strong>relationships</strong> with other Hollows, uncover dark secrets, and <strong>rebuild</strong> the settlement.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/69ceb1b6f52c27dfd56d1beb5e826938.poster.avif?t=1744289496\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/69ceb1b6f52c27dfd56d1beb5e826938.webm?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/69ceb1b6f52c27dfd56d1beb5e826938.mp4?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE BUILD = UNIQUE LOOK</h2>Each soul-card you select directly influences your character's <i>appearance</i>. Every unique combination creates a distinct look for the player.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/f525be109635bd0c29260bafbf5230d5.poster.avif?t=1744289496\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/f525be109635bd0c29260bafbf5230d5.webm?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/f525be109635bd0c29260bafbf5230d5.mp4?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</h2>Buy <strong>cosmetic upgrades</strong> to craft a unique look for your character. From subtle tweaks to dramatic transformations, you have the freedom to customize your hero exactly how you envision.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/4544615fb5ece3b4ea12e1abdd77e63c.poster.avif?t=1744289496\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/4544615fb5ece3b4ea12e1abdd77e63c.webm?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909680/extras/4544615fb5ece3b4ea12e1abdd77e63c.mp4?t=1744289496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience an exciting action-packed adventure where your choices and skills determine your fate. <strong>Will you rise to the <i>ultimate test</i>?</strong>",
